OL,3,A'Kemi's family home pledge' and
OL,4,A'Badenoch invokes core Tory values'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMost of the front pages lead with Kemi
OL,7,FBadenoch's Conservative conference
OL,8,Fspeech yesterday. "We're ready for the
OL,9,Ffight"" is the Daily Telegraph's
OL,10,Fverdict on the Tory leader's message.
OL,11,FThe Financial Times says her promises
OL,12,Fto cut taxes represent a return to core
OL,13,FConservative values, but the Guardian
OL,14,Fdescribes them as "prioritising the
OL,15,Fwealthiest". The Daily Express believes
OL,16,FBadenoch is a "no nonsense" leader - a
OL,17,Fphrase used by several papers - and
OL,18,Fthat she heads a party that will stop
OL,19,Fwhat it describes as inheritance tax
OL,20,F"raids". The Times says the
OL,21,FConservatives are now focused on wooing
OL,22,F"Middle England".
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
