OL,3,A'Kemi's family home pledge' and
OL,4,A'Badenoch invokes core Tory values'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Guardian warns that the
OL,7,Fgovernment's reforms to the special
OL,8,Feducation system in England could
OL,9,F"unravel" because parents are rushing
OL,10,Fto secure support before any changes
OL,11,Fare implemented. It says experts are
OL,12,Fnow urging ministers to review the
OL,13,Ftimeline for their plans, which they
OL,14,Fclaim are based on optimistic
OL,15,Fassumptions. The Department for
OL,16,FEducation says it's committed to
OL,17,Fimplementing its plans by 2030.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/3
